  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Opened in 2025, Woof &amp; Wow is a fully fenced, free-access dog park set in the Base Nature François Léotard, a site of more than 100 hectares developed on former naval air bases. An agility course with fun obstacles lets your dog burn off energy safely.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Access is strictly forbidden to category 1 and 2 dogs (source: city of Fréjus). The park is free and open access, with a reinforced escape-proof fence, three pedestrian gates and a wide vehicle gate. A built-in water point (push tap) lets your dog drink on site. The site is crossed by flat, paved paths, easy for the whole family.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: combine your visit with a stop at Pacha Plage, right next door, to extend the outing by the water.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Base Nature François Léotard offers more than 100 hectares to explore, and Pacha Plage is just a few steps away to end the day.</p>
    </div>

